      "summary": {
        "zh": "朱荣院士团队牵头攻关的近零碳排电炉短流程炼钢国家级示范项目在靖江特钢投产。",
        "en": "A national demonstration project led by Academician Rong Zhu’s team has entered production at Jingjiang Special Steel."
      },
      "image": "assets/news-green-steel.jpg",
      "source": {
        "zh": "北京科技大学微信公众号 · 央视新闻报道",
        "en": "USTB WeChat account · CCTV News coverage"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "zh": "据北京科技大学2026年10月15日发布的报道，由朱荣院士科研团队牵头攻关的国内首个近零碳排电炉短流程炼钢国家级示范项目在靖江特钢投产。",
          "en": "According to USTB’s report published on 15 October 2026, China’s first national demonstration project for near-zero-carbon short-route EAF steelmaking, developed under the leadership of Rong Zhu’s team, entered production at Jingjiang Special Steel."
        },
        {
          "zh": "项目以再生钢铁原料为主要生产原料，采用生物质燃气、生物质炭等替代传统化石燃料，结合光伏、风电等绿色能源，以电代煤，重熔废钢制造高品质特种钢。",
          "en": "The project uses recycled steel feedstock, biomass gas and biomass char in place of conventional fossil fuels, together with solar, wind and other green electricity, to remelt scrap into high-quality special steel."
        },
        {
          "zh": "报道介绍，项目通过能源、冶炼过程与原料端协同减碳，并采用CO₂喷吹控氮和终点控氧等洁净化技术，在降低碳排放的同时改善钢水质量。",
          "en": "The report describes coordinated carbon reduction in energy supply, the melting process and feedstock production. CO₂ injection for nitrogen control and end-point oxygen control support improved steel quality while reducing emissions."
        },
        {
          "zh": "报道所述“100%绿电+100%废钢+高效电炉”短流程炼钢模式，相对传统长流程炼钢可实现碳排放90%以上减排。该数据对应报道中的示范项目及比较条件。",
          "en": "The reported “100% green electricity + 100% scrap + efficient EAF” route achieves more than 90% lower carbon emissions than conventional integrated steelmaking under the demonstration project’s stated comparison conditions."
        }
      ],
