        "zh": "团队自主研发电弧炉炼钢复合吹炼成套技术与装备，创新搭建智能化能效评价系统与高效协同供能模型。有效缩短电弧炉冶炼周期、显著提升钢水洁净度，实现能源精准最优匹配，解决底吹寿命与炉龄不匹配行业难题。目前该技术已成功推广应用于国内外百余座电弧炉，产业化落地成效显著。",
        "en": "The team developed integrated combined-blowing technologies and equipment, an intelligent energy-efficiency evaluation system and a coordinated energy-supply model. These advances shorten EAF melting cycles, improve steel cleanliness, optimize energy matching and align bottom-blowing component life with furnace campaigns. The technology has been applied in more than 100 EAFs in China and abroad."
