  "overview": [
    {
      "zh": "朱荣院士领衔的绿色低碳炼钢团队，长期面向国家“双碳”战略和钢铁工业绿色低碳转型重大需求，深耕绿色低碳钢铁冶金基础研究、关键技术攻关与工程化应用。团队围绕低碳炼钢、洁净钢生产、CO₂资源化利用等关键技术领域持续攻坚，揭示了CO₂调控炼钢反应机理，开发了CO₂顶底复合喷吹、源头降尘、高效脱磷、强化脱氮及多元气体耦合调控等关键技术，推动CO₂由工业废气向资源功能型介质的转变，为高品质钢绿色生产和钢铁流程减碳提供了重要技术路径；主持研发了电炉炼钢复合吹炼技术，有效破解了能量利用率低等难题；发明了钢液深度净化技术，成功突破了全废钢低氮、低磷钢冶炼技术瓶颈；研发全球首例氢基竖炉—近零碳排电弧炉技术，为钢铁工业低碳冶炼提供重要技术支撑。",
      "en": "Led by Academician Rong Zhu, the Green & Low-Carbon Steelmaking Team addresses China’s carbon-peaking and carbon-neutrality goals and the steel industry’s green transition through fundamental research, key technology development and engineering applications. The team investigates low-carbon steelmaking, clean steel production and CO₂ utilization. It has elucidated how CO₂ regulates steelmaking reactions and developed combined top-and-bottom CO₂ injection, dust reduction at source, efficient dephosphorization, enhanced nitrogen removal and coupled multi-gas control. These advances turn CO₂ from an industrial waste gas into a functional process medium, supporting cleaner high-quality steel and lower process emissions. The team has also developed combined-blowing electric steelmaking to improve energy utilization, deep steel-melt purification for low-nitrogen and low-phosphorus production from all-scrap charges, and the world’s first hydrogen-based shaft furnace–near-zero-carbon electric arc furnace technology.",
      "_order": 10
    },
    {
      "zh": "团队坚持产学研深度融合，相关技术成果已在全国200余家钢企推广应用。近年来，团队成员主持国家级、省部级及校企合作项目100余项，先后获国家科技进步二等奖4项（三项第一）、何梁何利科学与技术进步奖、全国创新争先奖、省部级特等奖1项、一等奖8项，发表论文210余篇，授权国内外专利110余项，制定国家及行业标准9项，出版专著8部，相关成果入选国家工信部低碳技术目录等。",
      "en": "The team integrates university research with industry practice, with technologies deployed at more than 200 steel enterprises across China. In recent years, its members have led over 100 national, provincial, ministerial and university–industry projects; received four Second Prizes of the State Science and Technology Progress Award, with the team ranked first in three, the Ho Leung Ho Lee Science and Technology Progress Award, the National Innovation Award, one provincial or ministerial Special Prize and eight First Prizes; published over 210 papers; secured over 110 Chinese and international patents; developed nine national and industry standards; and published eight monographs. Its achievements have been included in the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology’s catalogue of low-carbon technologies.",
      "_order": 20
    }
  ],
